'''Land-Air Assault''' (空陸連携作戦, ''Kūriku Renkei-Sakusen'', '''Coordinated Air-Land Operation''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 11.8 Update|Version 11.8]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Unit Attack UP (M): Cats' attack power increases by 15%.

